      },
      {
        "native_id": "hdgvrwj7dn2t",
        "status": "resolved",
        "body": "Between 09:31 and 10:13 UTC on 23 October 2026 (42 minutes), Grafana Cloud Traces in AWS Germany experienced elevated ingestion latency and intermittent trace write failures, affecting both direct trace ingestion and ingestion via the OpenTelemetry endpoint. All services are now operating normally.",
